<div class="textwidget">
<p>SAVANT is primarily funded by the <a class="customize-unpreviewable" href="https://esrc.ukri.org/">ESRC</a> with additional support from the <a class="customize-unpreviewable" href="https://wp.nyu.edu/nellab/">NeLLab operating grant.</a> The project is a collaboration between <a class="customize-unpreviewable" href="https://www.qmul.ac.uk/">QMUL</a>, <a class="customize-unpreviewable" href="https://www.uni-lj.si/university/">UvL</a> and <a class="customize-unpreviewable" href="https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/">NYUAD</a>.</p>
